# In development the API is reached through the development server's proxy, so the base URL is
# relative to the application's own origin. That is what makes the cart work: the API tracks the
# basket in a session cookie, and a browser only sends that cookie on same-origin requests.
#
# See the `server.proxy` block in vite.config.ts and the "The cart counter" section of the README.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/
